Package: contactdataformat
Title: Check Social Contact Survey Data Against the SOCRATES Format
Version: 1.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Lander",
      family = "Willem",
      email = "lander.willem@uantwerpen.be",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
      )
  )
Description: Validates whether a social contact survey dataset follows the
  SOCRATES data-formatting guidelines (the file layout used by the
  'socialmixr' package and the SOCRATES tools). A versioned schema is the
  single source of truth for file names, columns, types, allowed values and
  keys. 'check_contact_data()' runs automatic, cross-table and heuristic rules,
  lists the items that need human judgement, and returns a structured report
  that can be written to Markdown, CSV or JSON.
